{"id": "clm:4f11af05bab8a7bb6f9ba73d949ef20993d3d02b1d40d341b56173328c224a2c", "type": "statement", "text": "Inference from the pinned implementation and Python parsing contract: malformed date strings can raise ValueError locally because the conversion helper does not catch parsing exceptions. Missing payload keys instead leave the dictionary unchanged; conversion is not comprehensive metadata validation. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0a838914098259e247357450f4d20de4df96acbeeaf02902c543700bee300174", "ev:79f2b5022fe87140b88d33cf4e26392fcc988de86a491b1671cd2a6af05eb6ef"]}
{"id": "clm:201e29c2a9fc629c5e92f0b644eddd2231800ce17c292e44fc5d625f1fe4cb97", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, visit_structured_query returns (structured_query.query, {}) when structured_query.filter is None. When a filter exists, it instead returns that query with {\"pre_filter\": filter.accept(translator)}. The translator itself adds no limit parameter. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://langchain-mongodb.readthedocs.io/en/stable/_modules/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5274826a408828e0afa537618b78176c985547a2c4aa30790cb073d9c731b1c4"]}
{"id": "clm:69a032085ef218b6634847416a0a8f2044c7c5408ecbff4dc0e3f7065b330646", "type": "statement", "text": "A March 5, 2024 issue reports an Atlas date operand rejection with langchain_mongodb 0.1.0 despite supplying a Python datetime. That historical server-side report does not establish failure of the pinned translator or prove that its conversion guarantees server acceptance. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/18604", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:e92daa50a5c1800693978554eb30daa0538392316e3755d61c1a2ff87b5c760e"]}
{"id": "clm:df280d52f16aef631ff405968bd4ad732bcea558c3bd83e5f5bc1c7412af0d7e", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, IN/NIN wrap every non-list comparison.value in a one-element list, mutating the Comparison object before conversion. Existing lists remain lists; a tuple is wrapped rather than expanded. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://langchain-mongodb.readthedocs.io/en/stable/_modules/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9a4a609e2a80ae2249e12dad5a8a3ddde4dd62c69fa40a6b7b81f8ce77020b46"]}
{"id": "clm:8401086a32c14b9a7ddbd94405f5cfcd6af9612ffc996adc95c9149586401c28", "type": "statement", "text": "At commit d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d, allowed comparators are EQ, NE, GT, GTE, LT, LTE, IN and NIN; their MongoDB spellings are $eq, $ne, $gt, $gte, $lt, $lte, $in and $nin. Logical operators are limited to AND and OR, mapped to $and and $or. _format_func calls the inherited validator before mapping; NOT is absent. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://langchain-mongodb.readthedocs.io/en/stable/_modules/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9c00c6b8d97c01de5a1984ac6f26e810756b39da7adb6f3bdf36ce28b294da32"]}
{"id": "clm:fa0a3a9e64fcce6eacae45d1702ffd541426f86b157e42f6d4266df22859e76f", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, visit_operation recursively visits its arguments and emits {\"$and\": [...]} or {\"$or\": [...]}. visit_comparison emits {attribute: {mapped_comparator: converted_value}}; nested logical trees retain their grouping. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://langchain-mongodb.readthedocs.io/en/stable/_modules/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.html", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/tests/unit_tests/test_retrievers.py", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/tests/integration_tests/test_retriever_selfquerying.py"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9c00c6b8d97c01de5a1984ac6f26e810756b39da7adb6f3bdf36ce28b294da32", "ev:d5bbfe137c2565098503ba1bb70193fffe5561634a2d0e9f474431a70703d0d3"]}
{"id": "clm:e20f7b523df18bb24a17245ba5097d6aea58f98e0346bf4a8adbeba5051f00e1", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, {\"type\":\"date\",\"date\":\"YYYY-MM-DD\"} converts through datetime.datetime.strptime(value[\"date\"], \"%Y-%m-%d\"). Python parsing defaults make the result midnight with no timezone information. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/tests/unit_tests/test_retrievers.py"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0a838914098259e247357450f4d20de4df96acbeeaf02902c543700bee300174", "ev:79f2b5022fe87140b88d33cf4e26392fcc988de86a491b1671cd2a6af05eb6ef", "ev:9ab79b638beb38a2472a593c67e694b234b42bc2b8ea11b3a70b6cf490171859", "ev:b2589d3bcff5d8589879df969b0cb6203ebf5dd6a7e83b66a82dab52de0cea7a"]}
{"id": "clm:3a9d2e8f850cdd92ed8826ecde660015b358799176412807cb5524f8112088f1", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, a dictionary tagged type=datetime with a datetime key has Z replaced by +00:00 before datetime.datetime.fromisoformat. Explicit offsets survive parsing; strings without offsets produce naive datetime objects. The translator does not force every value to UTC. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/tests/unit_tests/test_retrievers.py"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0a838914098259e247357450f4d20de4df96acbeeaf02902c543700bee300174", "ev:e8ccd81e1ee925cdef7f155e6f3dddd29af6215bfbe4a2f2cc182dba76d8f980"]}
{"id": "clm:b8657095b323b31553c6c5f4b352c1f982b5bf3718a8b491ecf892853234a30f", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, list conversion recursively processes elements, including nested lists and typed date/datetime dictionaries. Scalar IN/NIN date dictionaries therefore become lists containing Python datetime values. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://langchain-mongodb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_modules/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0a838914098259e247357450f4d20de4df96acbeeaf02902c543700bee300174"]}
{"id": "clm:e513bb7f7eec05e5a1be6df1d646bdd0a580ad126720f847a908f22448120897", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, untagged dictionaries, other type tags, and tagged dictionaries missing their date/datetime payload key pass through unchanged. Ordinary dictionaries are not traversed. Strings, numbers, booleans and existing datetime objects receive no general type coercion. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://langchain-mongodb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_modules/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.html", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/tests/unit_tests/test_retrievers.py"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0a838914098259e247357450f4d20de4df96acbeeaf02902c543700bee300174"]}
{"id": "clm:b3ab0013818a31bf0a198788b2be7224d20ae82dcd43e374ba6d7596ba188a31", "type": "statement", "text": "At the pinned commit, _similarity_search_with_score passes pre_filter to vector_search_stage for explicit vectors and to autoembedding_vector_search_stage for automatic embedding. pipelines.py imports both builders from pymongo_search_utils; the inspected translator does not implement BSON encoding or the downstream builder. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/vectorstores.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/pipelines.py", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3b04edfc373f1851a8cf1a5e42a4e18c00859fd7d91c9ebdba46785110bc82fb", "ev:40db60958f9999058ad6f0c73a6f6f6389fcfd1398ccd95a675adb7367433999", "ev:a72ff8448a7da4aaa87fe0cce7d3e64851b3c89cdd393191d77ea4fb36d508de"]}
{"id": "clm:75150a73f1f6aa346cd53f07913684ddf11753b05b66ab1f6314f1226896e7cd", "type": "statement", "text": "The stable documentation source rendering lacks the datetime conversion helper and returns comparison.value directly after IN/NIN wrapping. The pinned source includes that helper. Treating the stable rendering as evidence for the pinned date behavior would therefore be incorrect. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/langchain-ai/langchain-mongodb/d7d6913d1f31a146236154db18d6c222d2df492d/libs/langchain-mongodb/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Pinned LangChain MongoDB self-query filter translation and typed metadata values"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://langchain-mongodb.readthedocs.io/en/stable/_modules/langchain_mongodb/retrievers/self_querying.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:8a6d2e49d8cf76cf9076600ed8bf0643ce8513f63031e98437204a62a042fdd5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:40db60958f9999058ad6f0c73a6f6f6389fcfd1398ccd95a675adb7367433999", "ev:89e9e53adb00077dc984e5901d1db18ca7f0fa47baae1fb08d835ed7d07ded79"]}
